WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:00.896
Sometimes,

00:00:00.896 --> 00:00:04.460
the biggest thing stopping you from changing your life...

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:06.074
isn't the world.

00:00:06.224 --> 00:00:09.128
It's what's happening inside your own mind.

00:00:09.278 --> 00:00:09.870
First,

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:11.054
there's Motivation.

00:00:11.204 --> 00:00:13.340
It makes you start with excitement...

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:16.106
but disappears when things get difficult.

00:00:16.256 --> 00:00:17.600
Then there's Ego.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.710
It makes you work just to prove people wrong...

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:23.924
even when nobody is watching.

00:00:24.074 --> 00:00:26.138
Then comes Obsession.

00:00:26.288 --> 00:00:29.456
It makes you chase success so hard...

00:00:29.606 --> 00:00:33.446
you forget what you're sacrificing along the way.

00:00:33.596 --> 00:00:35.060
But there's something different.

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:36.386
Discipline.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:38.312
It doesn't need excitement.

00:00:38.462 --> 00:00:40.310
It doesn't need applause.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.572
It simply makes you show up...

00:00:42.722 --> 00:00:45.578
even on the days you don't feel like it.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.124
Because motivation depends on feelings.

00:00:50.274 --> 00:00:52.794
Ego depends on approval.

00:00:52.944 --> 00:00:56.016
And obsession can make you forget yourself.

00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:59.502
But discipline reminds you why you started.

00:00:59.652 --> 00:01:00.084
So,

00:01:00.084 --> 00:01:00.948
ask yourself...

00:01:01.098 --> 00:01:04.002
Are you building the life you actually want...

00:01:04.152 --> 00:01:07.992
or are you being controlled by what's inside your mind?

